@startuml
title Planned autonomous lifecycle and inputs that must agree
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
component "Implemented scheduler (TPC-21)\nuser + timezone + due date\nretry / catch-up / overlap policy" as schedule
component "Existing sync service\ntransactions + balances + debts" as sync
component "Existing budget graph\nfit / pace / diagnose / decide" as budget
component "Implemented recurring detector\n180-day transaction window" as recurring
component "Implemented cash forecast\nchecking cash + scheduled bills\n+ income + everyday spending" as forecast
component "Implemented debt-payoff planner\nminimums + APR + extra amount" as payoff
component "Goal graph\npropose affordable goals,\nuser accepts or dismisses each\n(interrupt, TPC-25)" as goal
component "Existing approval core + API\nalerts and goals" as approval
component "Implemented period-close service\nexisting pure close maths\n+ DB rollover + accepted proposals" as close
schedule ..> sync : daily
sync --> budget : current balances / transactions
sync --> recurring
recurring --> forecast : future inflows / outflows
recurring --> budget : new / changed streams
forecast --> payoff : monthly surplus
payoff ..> goal : computed plans
goal --> approval : proposals
budget --> approval : proposed next limit
schedule ..> close : month end
approval ..> close : accepted cents +\naccepted goals (new lines)
close ..> budget : next month's persisted lines
note bottom of recurring
Annual detection is deferred. Tight cadence,
price-step, restart and monthly anchor rules
are measured on planted and noisy users.
end note
note bottom of forecast
Define pending vs posted, checking vs card
spend, duplicate card payments, currency,
and the income floor before trusting surplus.
end note
legend bottom
Dashed = planned integration / component
Solid = existing callable building blocks
No service moves money.
endlegend
@enduml
